Signal (the reclaim candle is the latest daily candle):
1. SMA50 rising (today > 10 trading days ago)
2. Pullback: a close below SMA21 within the 10 days before today
3. Today the first close above JMA(13,40,2; TradingView formula), EMA8, SMA21
   and SMA50 (yesterday was not above all four)
4. RSI(14) today between 57 and 63
Defaults (not requested): Entry = today's close, Stop = lowest low of the
pullback, Quantity/Total_Amount for a $40 max loss.

